{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13220460","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13220460","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1322046001:1":{"text":"里芙娜和亚历克斯已经跟我说了今晚的事情，很抱歉，看起来我还是来迟了。","source_cn":"里芙娜和亚历克斯已经跟我说了今晚的事情，很抱歉，看起来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08F7FECB7F93E005","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322046002:1":{"text":"你们还好吗？","source_cn":"你们还好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x017CE7CCBCD795CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1322046002":{"text":"你们还好吗？","source_cn":"你们还好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x017CE7CCBCD795CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322046003:1":{"text":"和她打架很有趣，但是疼！","source_cn":"和她打架很有趣，但是疼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D7913F65063C81B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322046004:0":{"text":"那位女亡灵，还有她的儿子，他们真的对雪松镇的人没有敌意吗？","source_cn":"那位女亡灵，还有她的儿子，他们真的对雪松镇的人没有敌意吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x481EB89A0328400B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322046005:1":{"text":"看起来戴